      "html": "<table><thead><tr><td>The undersigned is directed 20th February, 1991</td><td>to say that with effect from</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>(i) Shri Vidya Charan Shukla has relinquished the office of the Minister of External Affairs. ) Shri Shakeelur Rehman has relinquished the office of the Minister of Health &amp; Family Welfare. Shri Basavaraj Patil has relinquished the office of the ) Minister of State in the Ministry of Steel and Mines. Shri Bhagey Gobardhan has relinquished the office of ) the Minister of State in the Ministry of Human Resource Development. ii iii iv</td><td>(ii</td><td>)</td><td>) (iii</td><td>) (iv</td></tr><tr><td>(v)</td><td>Shri Sarwar Hussain has relinquished the office of the Minister of State in the Ministry of Food and Civil Supplies.</td></tr></tbody></table>"
